[38;5;252m[1m## The two findings worth knowing[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The translation's most fragile point is a UB corner it handles deliberately. [38;5;10minreftree[0m computes [38;5;10mop_string[tree_sum % 4][0m; C's [38;5;10m%[0m truncates toward zero, so a negative sum indexes [3mbefore[23m the [38;5;10m"+*-%"[0m literal. The Rust embeds the C compiler's whole [38;5;10m.rodata[0m literal block ([38;5;10mroot\0left\0right\0left-left\0+*-%\0[0m) at offset 26 rather than guessing. [38;5;10mobjdump -s -j .rodata[0m on the C [38;5;10m.so[0m confirms that layout, and all seven reachable indices (−3..3) read identical bytes.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Two inputs are excluded from comparison because the C does not return at all: [38;5;10mdivide_op(INT_MIN, -1)[0m and [38;5;10mmodulo_op(INT_MIN, -1)[0m raise SIGFPE (I confirmed this — exit 136), while the Rust's [38;5;10mwrapping_div[0m/[38;5;10mwrapping_rem[0m return [38;5;10mINT_MIN[0m/[38;5;10m0[0m. Neither is reachable from [38;5;10minreftree[0m ([38;5;10mop_string[0m contains no [38;5;10m/[0m, and [38;5;10mmodulo_op[0m only ever sees divisors 1 or 2). Also excluded, and documented in [38;5;10mERRORS.md[0m: negative [38;5;10mnode_count[0m (out-of-bounds store in both) and child-link cycles (unbounded recursion in both).[0m[0m
