[38;5;252m[1m## One caveat on trust[0m[0m
[0m[0m
A differential suite that never fails proves nothing, so I mutation-tested the harness with six injected bugs. Five were killed. The sixth — dropping [38;5;10mlabel[31] = 0[0m — [3msurvived[23m, because [38;5;10mstrncpy(...,31)[0m never writes that byte, making the store observable only over a dirty slot. I added [38;5;10mCONFIGS.md[0m row 22 to cover it, and confirmed the new test kills that mutant. The [38;5;10mstrncpy(...,31)[0m → [38;5;10m(...,32)[0m mutant also survived, but that one is provably equivalent (the following [38;5;10mlabel[31]=0[0m overwrites the only differing byte). The mutation results are recorded in [38;5;10mCONFIGS.md[0m.[0m[0m
